{"publicId":"73f0bc87-5647-47ac-b868-922d4f7f4fc1","title":"汇丰香港首次允许用RedCoin认购代币化基金","status":"active","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-19T07:31:36.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-19T07:31:36.000Z","digest":"汇丰银行自2026-11-23起允许香港零售客户通过稳定币RedCoin认购汇丰环球货币基金-港元的代币化份额，最低投资门槛为100枚RedCoin（等值100港元），这是该稳定币首次应用于零售财富管理【新】。早前报道仅提及通过移动应用以港元认购该基金，未披露代币化规则，此次补充了RedCoin作为投资媒介的细节【旧】。目前开放渠道为汇丰移动应用，但未明确代币发行规则、交易限制或跨境适用性【新】【旧】。","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-19T09:10:04.363Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"汇丰推出RedCoin代币化基金投资","latestReport":{"id":"tqi02moc1uq6t32msk2l52d72"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":2,"newParticipants6h":0,"recentReports24h":2,"observationComplete":true,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"fWOop7Dfips0","title":"HSBC 开启 RedCoin 资产代币化基金的认购","firstReportAt":"2026-11-19T07:31:36.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"tqi02moc1uq6t32msk2l52d72","title":"汇丰推出RedCoin代币化基金投资","summary":"汇丰银行通过移动应用向香港零售客户开放了一只现有货币市场基金的新代币化份额投资，起投金额为100港元。","source":{"name":"The Defiant","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-19T07:31:36.000Z","selected":false}}],"officialReports":[],"timeline":[{"id":"tqi02moc1uq6t32msk2l52d72","title":"汇丰推出RedCoin代币化基金投资","summary":"汇丰银行通过移动应用向香港零售客户开放了一只现有货币市场基金的新代币化份额投资，起投金额为100港元。","source":{"name":"The Defiant","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-19T07:31:36.000Z","selected":false}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-19T09:00:00.000Z","heat":19.1,"participants":2},{"hour":"2026-11-19T10:00:00.000Z","heat":18.6,"participants":2},{"hour":"2026-11-19T11:00:00.000Z","heat":18.1,"participants":2},{"hour":"2026-11-19T12:00:00.000Z","heat":17.6,"participants":2},{"hour":"2026-11-19T13:00:00.000Z","heat":17.1,"participants":2},{"hour":"2026-11-19T14:00:00.000Z","heat":16.6,"participants":2},{"hour":"2026-11-19T15:00:00.000Z","heat":16.1,"participants":2},{"hour":"2026-11-19T16:00:00.000Z","heat":15.6,"participants":2},{"hour":"2026-11-19T17:00:00.000Z","heat":15.2,"participants":2},{"hour":"2026-11-19T18:00:00.000Z","heat":14